ommander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"banned","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{R}","name":"Kuldotha Rebirth","oracle_id":"f3e28778-0149-4dbd-badb-ba5aeacacd76","oracle_text":"As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact.\nCreate three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2010-10-01","toughness":null,"type_line":"Sorcery"},{"cmc":3.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"restricted"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}","name":"Trinisphere","oracle_id":"69d994f2-b8f6-425f-9655-977c2144d40c","oracle_text":"As long as this artifact is untapped, each spell that would cost less than three mana to cast costs three mana to cast. (Additional mana in the cost may be paid with any color of mana or colorless mana. For example, a spell that would cost {1}{B} to cast costs {2}{B} to cast instead.)","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2020-08-07","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"If Trinisphere leaves the battlefield or becomes tapped or untapped as a cost to cast a spell, this cost is paid after you've locked in the total cost.","oracle_id":"69d994f2-b8f6-425f-9655-977c2144d40c","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you're paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. Finally, apply Trinisphere's effect if the mana component of the spell's cost is less than three mana. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.","oracle_id":"69d994f2-b8f6-425f-9655-977c2144d40c","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you're paying (such as the alternative cost of Daze), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was.","oracle_id":"70486bee-6ee7-41ea-b834-8caf4699302b","published_at":"2026-03-20","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Two Goblin Electromancers will make instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {2} less to cast, and so on.","oracle_id":"81f06f84-1580-43c0-89d5-08d34541a519","published_at":"2017-03-14","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Goblin Electromancer's effect reduces only generic mana in the spell's total cost.","oracle_id":"81f06f84-1580-43c0-89d5-08d34541a519","published_at":"2018-10-05","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you're paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.","oracle_id":"81f06f84-1580-43c0-89d5-08d34541a519","published_at":"2018-10-05","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.","oracle_id":"9afb3b6e-4909-4efa-aa79-81c0229411c9","published_at":"2011-06-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.","oracle_id":"9afb3b6e-4909-4efa-aa79-81c0229411c9","published_at":"2011-06-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you're at 1 life or less, you can't pay 2 life.","oracle_id":"9afb3b6e-4909-4efa-aa79-81c0229411c9","published_at":"2011-06-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can't produce Phyrexian mana.","oracle_id":"9afb3b6e-4909-4efa-aa79-81c0229411c9","published_at":"2011-06-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.","oracle_id":"9afb3b6e-4909-4efa-aa79-81c0229411c9","published_at":"2011-06-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
